  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;be such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
